00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
- If you are a young business graduate

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.760
and are thinking about what
the first job should be

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.450
that you should accept
fresh out of university

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.310
and if you are looking to be successful

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:11.040
in the business world in the long-term,

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.490
I believe my humble opinion
that joining consulting firm

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.860
is probably the best career
move that you can take.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.390
But before we jump into that,

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:21.490
I have some great news to share.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:25.590
Look at this baby that
arrived over the weekend.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.160
Let's take a few moments
to celebrate this baby.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.870
Hi guys, how's it going?

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.980
Hope you're all having a great day.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.720
So this is not the first time

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.700
